<h1>Eidolon Science Fiction</h1>

<p>
Eidolon is an Australian Semi-Prozine, published from North 
Perth, Australia.  Almost all of the information found here comes from
<i>Eidolon's</i>
<a href="http://www.midnight.com.au/eidolon/home.htm">web page</a>.
This is, by far, the best web page of any magazine on the net to date,
Pro or Semi-Pro; it essentially puts all of their back issues online,
in a format similar to its original print run.
<p>
Eidolon is a quarterly publication and is available by subscription at
a cost of A$27.80 per four issues, Overseas: A$45 (Air), A$35 (Surface),
payable to Eidolon Publications, PO Box 225, North Perth, West Australia,
6006.
<p>
The magazine may also be purchased on single issue basis in the United States from 
Mark V. Ziesing Bookseller, P O Box 76 Shingletown CA 960880.
